e":"Soulection Radio Show #510","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-510.png","content":"Joe Kay gets you ready for his upcoming Las Vegas residency.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-06-19T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"hNCVSissXHc","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"One Way - Mr. Groove","track":{"id":"MTHKN8-AEO4","path":"/artists/one-way/tracks/mr-groove/","slug":"mr-groove","title":"Mr. Groove","artist":{"slug":"one-way","title":"One Way"},"artwork":"images/artists/one-way/tracks/mr-groove.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andres' Set","position":2}},{"id":"NWIynvgNXss","position":74,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"One Way - Mr. Groove","track":{"id":"MTHKN8-AEO4","path":"/artists/one-way/tracks/mr-groove/","slug":"mr-groove","title":"Mr. Groove","artist":{"slug":"one-way","title":"One Way"},"artwork":"images/artists/one-way/tracks/mr-groove.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"mHEhjKcfc_4","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"One Way - Don't Stop (Ever Loving Me)","track":{"id":"mDqvlz5jCEY","path":"/artists/one-way/tracks/don-t-stop-ever-loving-me/","slug":"dont-stop-ever-loving-me","title":"Don't Stop (Ever Loving Me)","artist":{"slug":"one-way","title":"One Way"},"artwork":"images/artists/one-way/tracks/don-t-stop-ever-loving-me.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"FASt_673SAE","slug":"266","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-266/ra.1128984985","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-266-ft-smino"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #266 w/ Smino","artwork":"/images/episodes/266.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7431,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-07-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"_lH-ryKw0sE","position":74,"timestamp":"01:53:24","rawTrack":"One Way - Don't Stop","track":{"id":"flnNOIFYZZo","path":"/artists/one-way/tracks/don-t-stop/","slug":"dont-stop","title":